{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-01_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-01","title":"冤家易结","storyCode":"5-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"89eda0843b9b9a11d9826813c29933a6f546ef733e70af6a67536ee54c319db8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以后我们就是朋友了。现在那些大人们，再也没办法欺负我们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别害怕，从今天开始无论发生什么，我都会帮你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我遇到什么坏事情，你可也一定要帮我哦！这就是朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我们不会分开的，对吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得那个老公爵掳走她时你做了什么吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为了龙门能做到哪一步，是否真的什么都可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，魏彦吾，你又要牺牲谁、牺牲什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司，醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......让我过去！让我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*，我哪有时间和你这么耗下去！"},{"type":"narration","text":"哗啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，快！整合运动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"白日梦做够了吗？真是的，一脸败相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么是你？我的队伍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我说全灭了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想挨打的话，建议去整合运动后面排队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上功夫一直厉害得很，战场上怎么见不到你这么凶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么回事？我才走开一小会儿，你们两个就又吵架吵成这个样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss.诗怀雅，少讽刺她两句对你没坏处，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈你也是，才刚醒就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你怎么湿得跟刚被园艺车浇过一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你问她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“小姐”，这空杯子是怎么回事？我记得我给你们两个人各倒了一杯水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"她梦里说胡话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的某个舱室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"三刻钟前，陈警司，你和你的小队逃窜回了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能觉得你们把自己的行踪隐藏得很好，但徘徊在龙门外围的整合运动并不这么想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["？？？","诗怀雅"]}]}
